msgid ""
"**Description**: Get disease summary information from the Alliance of "
"Genome Resources by Disease Ontology (DO) ID. Returns disease name, "
"definition, synonyms, and classification. The Alliance integrates disease"
" annotations from multiple model organism databases. Example: 'DOID:162' "
"returns cancer with definition and synonyms like 'malignant neoplasm'."
msgstr ""

