#: ../../tools/alliance_genome_tools.rst:63 79424bb91ce94922a77d7fb6f26d128a
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get genes associated with a disease across all model "
"organisms from the Alliance of Genome Resources. Uses Disease Ontology "
"(DO) IDs to find genes linked to a disease from human, mouse, rat, "
"zebrafish, fly, worm, and other organisms. Includes both direct "
"annotations and inferred associations from model organism phenotypes. "
"Example: 'DOID:162' (cancer) returns TP53, BRCA1, and thousands more."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/alliance_genome_tools.rst:70 27a38a7a134c461d92f1f744b75111a6
msgid ""
"``limit`` (integer) (optional) Maximum number of gene associations to "
"return (1-100). Default: 20."
msgstr ""

