#: ../../tools/alliance_genome_tools.rst:98 d2830ecd88b84a9994429e3e65d2a697
msgid "**Name**: ``Alliance_get_gene``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/alliance_genome_tools.rst:100 ded50dd5cd094049b256f722875ffda6
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get detailed gene information from the Alliance of "
"Genome Resources, which integrates data from 7 model organism databases "
"(SGD, FlyBase, WormBase, ZFIN, RGD, MGI, Xenbase) plus human. Returns "
"gene symbol, name, species, synopsis, synonyms, genomic location, and "
"cross-references. Example: 'HGNC:6081' returns insulin gene info."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/alliance_genome_tools.rst:104 693706eb07bf45aea087db6399142b22
msgid ""
"``gene_id`` (string) (required) Alliance gene ID with source prefix. "
"Examples: 'HGNC:6081' (human INS), 'MGI:98834' (mouse Trp53), "
"'FB:FBgn0003996' (fly w), 'SGD:S000000259' (yeast GAL4), 'ZFIN:ZDB-"
"GENE-990415-8' (zebrafish pax2a), 'WB:WBGene00006763' (worm unc-13)."
msgstr ""

