msgid "**Name**: ``Alliance_search_genes``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/alliance_genome_tools.rst:168 0fcbf943ef66440b84e2b62af4357ac6
msgid ""
"**Description**: Search for genes across all model organisms in the "
"Alliance of Genome Resources. Searches by gene symbol, name, or keyword "
"and returns matching genes from human, mouse, rat, zebrafish, fly, worm, "
"yeast, and frog databases. Provides type-ahead suggestions. Example: "
"'insulin' returns INS (human), Ins1/Ins2 (mouse), ins (zebrafish), etc."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/alliance_genome_tools.rst:172 03bf6ccc5b3f4260b7e2bc8af8d147d6
msgid ""
"``query`` (string) (required) Gene name, symbol, or keyword to search "
"for. Examples: 'insulin', 'tumor protein p53', 'hedgehog', 'notch'."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/alliance_genome_tools.rst:175 45ac7619b28d4344b8c6ba9ce47ad3c8
msgid ""
"``limit`` (integer) (optional) Maximum number of results to return "
"(1-50). Default: 10."
msgstr ""

